WEBVTT

00:02.540 --> 00:05.250
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:02.540 --> 00:05.250
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:06.170 --> 00:08.840
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:06.170 --> 00:08.840
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:09.750 --> 00:12.470
<i>Ai! Ai! Ai!</i>

00:09.750 --> 00:12.470
<i>Love! Love! Love!</i>

00:19.350 --> 00:22.180
<i>moeru you ni hitori demo</i>

00:19.350 --> 00:22.180
<i>I keep running, lying to myself</i>

00:22.180 --> 00:28.440
<i>ikiteyukeru to usobuite hashiritsudzukete</i>

00:22.180 --> 00:28.440
<i>that I can live alone, though the loneliness makes me burn</i>

00:28.440 --> 00:34.320
<i>unubore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta no ni</i>

00:28.440 --> 00:34.320
<i>You knew how fragile my self-conceit makes me</i>

00:34.320 --> 00:40.910
<i>kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni</i>

00:34.320 --> 00:40.910
<i>In this night that even shattered my heart</i>

00:40.910 --> 00:44.910
<i>kimi no koe sagasu</i>

00:40.910 --> 00:44.910
<i>I hate how weak I am</i>

00:44.910 --> 00:49.420
<i>kono yowasa ga nikui yo</i>

00:44.910 --> 00:49.420
<i>yearning for your voice</i>

00:49.420 --> 00:55.010
<i>ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya</i>

00:49.420 --> 00:55.010
<i>"I've got to get you back right now!"</i>

00:55.010 --> 00:56.550
<i>baka darou?</i>

00:55.010 --> 00:56.550
<i>I'm stupid, right?</i>

00:56.550 --> 00:57.760
<i>ai</i>

00:56.550 --> 00:57.760
<i>Love!</i>

00:57.760 --> 01:01.260
<i>kizudarake no ai wo shinjite</i>

00:57.760 --> 01:01.260
<i>Believing in my scarred love</i>

01:01.260 --> 01:11.150
<i>nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete</i>

01:01.260 --> 01:11.150
<i>I will turn these shedded tears into strength</i>

01:11.150 --> 01:11.980
<i>ai</i>

01:11.150 --> 01:11.980
<i>Love!</i>

01:11.980 --> 01:15.780
<i>kizudarake no ai da to shite mo</i>

01:11.980 --> 01:15.780
<i>Even though it is a scarred love</i>

01:15.780 --> 01:19.780
<i>bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru</i>

01:15.780 --> 01:19.780
<i>it lightens up our world</i>

01:19.780 --> 01:26.040
<i>kono ai mo ichido taritomo</i>

01:19.780 --> 01:26.040
<i>I will not let go of this love</i>

01:26.040 --> 01:28.880
<i>hanasanai</i>

01:26.040 --> 01:28.880
<i>for a single moment!</i>

01:30.380 --> 01:35.510
<b><b>EPISODE 46:
THE KICK-OFF OF THE CENTURY</b></b>

01:30.670 --> 01:32.960
Here, I brought your jerseys!

01:32.960 --> 01:34.210
Wow!

01:34.210 --> 01:36.010
Blue lines on white...

01:36.010 --> 01:39.470
Our home jerseys really are the best for our final match, after all.

01:39.470 --> 01:40.140
Yes!

01:40.140 --> 01:43.970
We washed them all properly, so do your best tomorrow!

01:43.970 --> 01:46.020
Yeah! You can count on us!

01:46.020 --> 01:48.650
Only one match stands in the way of the V3 we've dreamt of...

01:48.650 --> 01:49.400
You're right.

01:49.400 --> 01:54.940
I really wish Tsubasa was in top form, at least just for the final match.

01:54.940 --> 01:56.360
Oh, right.

01:56.360 --> 01:59.200
So, Tsubasa is staying at the hospital tonight.

01:59.200 --> 02:02.910
Nakazawa, wake up early tomorrow and bring him his jersey!

02:02.910 --> 02:04.700
Y-yes.

02:07.040 --> 02:07.960
<i>"I'll keep it short.</i>

02:07.960 --> 02:11.710
<i>Mr. Makoto Kitazume, coach of Toho Academy,</i>

02:11.710 --> 02:15.630
<i>I am writing this letter to ask a favor from you.</i>

02:15.630 --> 02:21.340
<i>Coach Kitazume, please let Kojiro Hyuga play in the final game.</i>

02:21.340 --> 02:24.350
<i>I can only assume you've not allowed him to play</i>

02:24.350 --> 02:30.140
<i>because he put his team aside and came to see me in Okinawa all by himself.</i>

02:30.140 --> 02:33.820
<i>But, can't you forgive him? Just this once?</i>

02:33.820 --> 02:36.610
<i>I was the one who urged him to come."</i>

02:42.700 --> 02:43.570
Come in.

02:45.830 --> 02:47.080
Hmm...?

02:48.000 --> 02:49.210
Coach.

02:49.210 --> 02:52.540
We've all discussed and decided on this together.

02:52.540 --> 02:54.710
Keeping that in mind, please listen to us.

02:54.710 --> 02:59.300
Please, let Captain Hyuga play in tomorrow's final.

03:00.510 --> 03:04.640
If you refuse to comply with our request,

03:04.640 --> 03:05.890
we will...

03:05.890 --> 03:07.930
Captain...?

03:09.310 --> 03:10.140
Captain!

03:10.140 --> 03:11.310
Hyuga!

03:19.690 --> 03:21.110
Coach.

03:21.110 --> 03:23.200
Take this.

03:23.200 --> 03:26.950
CHALLENGE LETTER

03:24.820 --> 03:25.990
Th-this is...

03:25.990 --> 03:26.950
Hyuga!

03:28.750 --> 03:31.250
Captain!

03:31.250 --> 03:33.290
CHALLENGE LETTER

03:36.090 --> 03:37.960
Tonight, at 8 p.m., I'll be waiting for you at Toho Football Club's pitch. Kojiro Hyuga

03:36.540 --> 03:41.920
"Tonight, at 8 p.m., I'll be waiting for you at Toho Football Club's pitch."

04:07.370 --> 04:10.700
Is Hyuga really intending to have a duel with him?

04:25.010 --> 04:26.550
Captain...!

04:26.550 --> 04:30.140
Really, I'd rather be found dead than like this...

04:30.140 --> 04:31.020
But,

04:31.770 --> 04:33.310
I should tell you now,

04:33.310 --> 04:36.850
this is as low as I can go.

04:36.850 --> 04:38.110
I'm begging you!

04:38.110 --> 04:40.360
Please let me play in the match!

04:46.320 --> 04:48.240
Raise your head, Hyuga.

04:49.910 --> 04:55.000
I have always coached football teams based on my convictions.

04:55.000 --> 04:59.290
I have never once betrayed those convictions.

04:59.290 --> 05:03.300
That is my pride, the foundations on which my coaching is built.

05:03.300 --> 05:07.590
And in staying true to those convictions,
I cannot let you play in this match!

05:09.010 --> 05:10.220
Got it?!

05:12.810 --> 05:14.430
Hyuga...

05:16.390 --> 05:17.940
I see...

05:22.150 --> 05:24.820
I don't really know or care about your convictions;

05:24.820 --> 05:26.950
so, then there's nothing else left to do!

05:28.240 --> 05:30.160
I will definitely play!

05:30.160 --> 05:33.740
Even if I have to beat you up, I'll force my way into that match!

05:33.740 --> 05:36.210
You don't own Toho!

05:36.210 --> 05:38.210
I won't just let you do as you please!

05:38.210 --> 05:41.290
The only one who's been doing as they've pleased here is you!

05:42.300 --> 05:42.960
Damn it!

05:45.050 --> 05:46.590
Wait, Captain!

05:47.590 --> 05:49.090
Coach, you stop too!

05:49.090 --> 05:50.680
You guys...

05:53.600 --> 05:55.480
It's as you see, coach!

05:55.480 --> 05:57.560
Please let Hyuga play in this match!

05:58.350 --> 06:01.310
It's true; our Captain left the team without your permission.

06:01.310 --> 06:05.400
But in Okinawa, all in preparation for our match against Nankatsu,

06:05.400 --> 06:07.070
just to take Nankatsu down,

06:07.070 --> 06:09.660
he has trained more intensely than any of us!

06:09.660 --> 06:11.160
We're begging you, Coach!

06:11.160 --> 06:13.330
Please, you have to let our Captain play!

06:13.330 --> 06:14.370
Coach, please!

06:14.370 --> 06:16.200
You guys...

06:16.200 --> 06:19.580
<i>You'd all go this far for Hyuga...? </i>

06:26.340 --> 06:28.510
Somebody bring a ball here.

06:30.840 --> 06:35.850
Hyuga, you just said that I didn't own Toho, right?

06:35.850 --> 06:39.640
However, I am the coach, and I make the decisions, here.

06:39.640 --> 06:45.400
And as things stand, even without you there, Toho have made their way through to the finals.

06:45.400 --> 06:49.240
The driving force behind this success are our forward, Sorimachi,

06:49.240 --> 06:51.450
our midfielder, Sawada,

06:51.450 --> 06:53.660
and our goalkeeper, Wakashimazu.

06:54.120 --> 06:57.250
If you can steal a goal from these three,

06:57.250 --> 06:58.700
Hyuga,

06:58.700 --> 07:00.330
then I'll let you play in the game.

07:02.670 --> 07:05.130
You won't go back on this promise, will you?

07:05.130 --> 07:09.170
However! If those three go easy on you because you're their friend,

07:09.170 --> 07:10.720
I won't let you play!

07:10.720 --> 07:12.590
You can't fool these eyes of mine.

07:12.590 --> 07:14.470
Got it, you lot?

07:14.470 --> 07:16.100
Y-yes!

07:22.190 --> 07:25.190
<i>We really can't fool our coach.</i>

07:25.190 --> 07:26.360
Blow the whistle!

07:26.360 --> 07:27.280
Yes!

07:27.940 --> 07:28.860
Let's go!

07:28.860 --> 07:29.440
Okay!

07:30.700 --> 07:32.200
Here I come, Hyuga!

07:33.740 --> 07:36.160
<i>Coach Kira has shown me the way,</i>

07:36.160 --> 07:38.540
<i>and helped me realize how naive I was.</i>

07:39.290 --> 07:42.000
<i>Kojiro! You have to fight with your body in football!</i>

07:42.000 --> 07:45.170
<i>No matter what happens, don't you abandon your fighting spirit!</i>

07:45.170 --> 07:46.960
<i>Okay!</i>

07:47.630 --> 07:49.130
<i>Fighting spirit!</i>

07:49.130 --> 07:52.970
<i>He beat that into me! Engraved it into my bones!</i>

07:53.470 --> 07:55.970
<i>To respond to Coach Kira's expectations,</i>

07:55.970 --> 07:58.720
<i>who has set me straight again,</i>

07:59.350 --> 08:01.730
<i>I shall play in that match!</i>

08:05.480 --> 08:11.280
<i>In my last summer, I found this amidst the typhoon, on the sandy beaches of northern Okinawa!</i>

08:12.280 --> 08:13.950
Tiger...

08:17.700 --> 08:19.990
Shot!

08:21.910 --> 08:23.040
What?!

08:23.040 --> 08:25.120
I couldn't see it! Not at all!

08:33.260 --> 08:34.590
It's not what you think!

08:34.590 --> 08:36.260
I wasn't going easy on him!

08:36.260 --> 08:37.850
That shot was just so fast, that I...

08:37.850 --> 08:39.600
I couldn't even react!

08:40.640 --> 08:42.560
I will announce the starting members

08:42.560 --> 08:44.350
for tomorrow's match against Nankatsu!

08:45.060 --> 08:47.230
Goalkeeper: Wakashimazu.

08:47.980 --> 08:48.770
Your response?

08:48.770 --> 08:50.230
Y-yes!

08:50.230 --> 08:51.480
Defenders: Imai.

08:51.480 --> 08:51.940
Yes!

08:51.940 --> 08:52.360
Kawabe.

08:52.360 --> 08:52.780
Yes!

08:52.780 --> 08:53.280
Takashima.

08:53.280 --> 08:53.690
Yes!

08:53.690 --> 08:54.150
Furuta.

08:54.150 --> 08:54.530
Yes!

08:54.530 --> 08:55.910
Midfielders: Shimano.

08:55.910 --> 08:56.360
Yes!

08:56.360 --> 08:56.820
Koike.

08:56.820 --> 08:57.110
Yes!

08:57.110 --> 08:57.620
Matsuki.

08:57.620 --> 08:58.160
Yes!

08:58.160 --> 08:58.740
Sawada.

08:58.740 --> 08:59.700
Yes!

08:59.700 --> 09:01.950
And the forwards: On the right wing, Sorimachi.

09:01.950 --> 09:02.660
Yes!

09:02.660 --> 09:04.870
And on the left wing...

09:06.420 --> 09:07.420
Kojiro Hyuga!

09:07.420 --> 09:08.670
Yes!

09:16.090 --> 09:20.300
<i>And then, finally, the dawn breaks on the day of the grand final.</i>

09:22.220 --> 09:24.980
TOHO ACADEMY CHAIRMAN

09:22.220 --> 09:24.980
NAOKI MIZAWA

09:22.520 --> 09:24.980
Can you please tell me your reason?

09:24.980 --> 09:27.060
A reason?

09:24.980 --> 09:27.060
RESIGNATION NOTICE

09:27.060 --> 09:30.980
My reason for quitting is the fact that I'll have Kojiro Hyuga play in today's match.

09:30.980 --> 09:32.190
Wha—

09:32.190 --> 09:36.780
Until now, I've coached according to my own convictions.

09:36.780 --> 09:41.740
But I've bent those convictions and
promised to let Hyuga play in this match.

09:41.740 --> 09:46.290
In other words, I have become a failure as a coach.

09:46.290 --> 09:48.290
I'll take responsibility for that,

09:48.290 --> 09:51.290
and quit coaching Toho Academy.

09:53.170 --> 09:54.760
Coach Kitazume...

09:54.760 --> 09:57.470
But rest assured.

09:57.470 --> 10:04.560
If I'm letting Kojiro Hyuga play,
it's for Toho Academy's victory.

10:05.770 --> 10:07.060
Listen to me, everyone!

10:07.060 --> 10:11.810
I want you to give it everything you've got and make even more noise in today's match.

10:11.810 --> 10:15.820
Our cheers are surely getting through to the players.

10:15.820 --> 10:18.780
Nankatsu will definitely emerge victorious today!

10:18.780 --> 10:19.820
Yeah!

10:19.820 --> 10:22.950
NAKATA HOSPITAL

10:22.950 --> 10:26.700
wipe that grin off your face, gurl

10:27.120 --> 10:30.040
Doctor, how is Tsubasa?

10:30.460 --> 10:34.420
Well, if he pushes himself too far and hurts himself again,

10:34.420 --> 10:39.550
it could cast a shadow on Tsubasa's football career for the rest of his life.

10:39.550 --> 10:44.680
If we care about his future, I should stop him, as his doctor.

10:44.680 --> 10:47.180
I understand what you're saying.

10:47.180 --> 10:49.190
What is Tsubasa's opinion on this?

10:49.190 --> 10:50.690
Eh...

10:51.350 --> 10:55.150
<i>Doctor, even if you tell me it's impossible, I'll still play in tomorrow's match.</i>

10:55.150 --> 10:58.690
<i>But, you would be putting your career
as a football player in danger...</i>

10:58.690 --> 11:00.650
<i>Hyuga is sure to play.</i>

11:00.650 --> 11:02.910
<i>I can only respond in kind.</i>

11:04.780 --> 11:06.370
I see.

11:06.370 --> 11:08.080
Then, please, let him play.

11:10.290 --> 11:13.580
If Tsubasa says he'll play, just let him play.

11:13.580 --> 11:16.340
Even if they lose when he plays,

11:16.340 --> 11:20.670
even if he can't become the #1 football player in the world due to getting hurt this match,

11:20.670 --> 11:26.180
Tsubasa isn't the kind of boy who'd have any regrets over choosing to play in this match.

11:26.680 --> 11:28.470
Mrs. Ozora...

11:28.470 --> 11:30.100
Good morning!

11:30.100 --> 11:31.640
Oh, Sanae...

11:31.640 --> 11:33.850
I brought Tsubasa's jersey.

11:33.850 --> 11:35.650
You did? Thank you!

11:35.650 --> 11:38.400
You're so strong, Mrs. Ozora.

11:38.400 --> 11:43.740
If it were me, I wouldn't let him play if his injuries were that bad.

11:44.870 --> 11:46.410
<i>Sanae...</i>

11:48.580 --> 11:50.330
Good morning, everyone!

11:50.330 --> 11:51.410
Tsubasa!

11:51.410 --> 11:52.370
Hey!

11:52.370 --> 11:56.000
Doctor, it's about time to put on the tape for the match. Please!

11:56.000 --> 11:57.590
O-okay...

11:57.590 --> 11:59.130
Hey, Tsubasa!

11:59.130 --> 12:00.630
Are you ready?

12:04.090 --> 12:06.470
Oh, it's you guys!

12:06.470 --> 12:11.520
Tsubasa! Today is our last official match as middle schoolers!

12:11.520 --> 12:15.400
Let's gather up for this final match,
and go out onto that field, together!

12:16.270 --> 12:17.770
Tsubasa!

12:18.320 --> 12:20.230
Guys...

12:20.230 --> 12:21.280
Tsubasa.

12:22.110 --> 12:23.320
Here, take this.

12:26.320 --> 12:27.240
Okay.

12:27.240 --> 12:28.530
Thanks!

12:29.240 --> 12:30.490
<i>She's so lucky...</i>

12:31.040 --> 12:32.870
<i>I wish I could be next to Tsubasa,</i>

12:32.870 --> 12:33.790
<i>just like that,</i>

12:34.620 --> 12:38.790
<i>even if it's only for once, this summer...</i>

12:39.710 --> 12:41.510
No, I can't! What am I thinking?!

12:41.510 --> 12:44.340
Yukari! Please, hit me!

12:44.340 --> 12:45.180
What...?

12:45.180 --> 12:47.510
What the hell are you going on about?

12:57.100 --> 12:57.900
They're here!

12:58.520 --> 12:59.900
Toho is here!

13:05.950 --> 13:09.280
TOHO ACADEMY

13:05.950 --> 13:09.280
10.15: ARRIVAL AT THE STADIUM

13:10.530 --> 13:12.160
And here comes Nankatsu!

13:17.790 --> 13:21.460
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL

13:17.790 --> 13:21.460
10.17: ARRIVAL AT THE STADIUM

13:21.460 --> 13:23.800
<i>This is my last official match in Japan,</i>

13:23.800 --> 13:26.930
<i>and also my last one as a middle schooler.</i>

13:26.930 --> 13:30.050
<i>It's also the match where I'll say farewell to everyone.</i>

13:40.860 --> 13:43.530
Do your best, do your best, Nankatsu!

13:43.530 --> 13:46.490
Fight, fight, Toho!

13:46.490 --> 13:49.410
Whoa, that's one hell of a crowd.

13:49.410 --> 13:51.030
It'll be hard to find a seat.

13:51.030 --> 13:52.620
Matsuyama!

13:52.620 --> 13:54.290
We're over here!

13:54.290 --> 13:56.120
Oh, Misugi and Yayoi!

13:56.830 --> 13:57.960
Thanks.

13:57.960 --> 14:00.080
That was a close one, yesterday.

14:00.080 --> 14:03.000
Yeah, and I was able to play without leaving any regrets.

14:03.000 --> 14:04.670
I'm satisfied, in a way.

14:05.090 --> 14:07.050
Are you the only one who stayed behind?

14:07.050 --> 14:08.260
Yeah.

14:08.260 --> 14:13.010
Coach told me I ought to watch this match for future reference.

14:13.010 --> 14:15.430
Also, if I'd gone back with them...

14:15.430 --> 14:18.480
<i>Captain, why did you go after her to the airport?</i>

14:18.480 --> 14:20.350
<i>What did you two talk about?</i>

14:20.350 --> 14:23.650
<i>Hey, hey! So you like Yoshiko too, right, Matsuyama?!</i>

14:25.480 --> 14:28.070
<i>...it'd end up like this for sure.</i>

14:28.450 --> 14:31.200
You two are really lucky, having been together all this time...

14:31.200 --> 14:32.570
Huh?

14:32.570 --> 14:34.660
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

14:33.580 --> 14:34.660
Excuse me.

14:35.580 --> 14:38.660
You must be Toho Academy's Coach Kitazume.

14:41.080 --> 14:43.250
Have you read my letter?

14:43.250 --> 14:45.420
My name is Kozo Kira.

14:45.880 --> 14:46.880
Kira, you say?

14:49.550 --> 14:50.680
It's just as you see.

14:50.680 --> 14:54.180
Please, I beg you, let Kojiro play in today's match!

14:55.010 --> 14:56.640
Coach Kira!

14:56.640 --> 14:57.640
Mr. Kira.

14:57.640 --> 14:59.020
Please, raise your head.

14:59.020 --> 15:01.850
I will absolutely not, not unless I hear he will play today.

15:02.310 --> 15:03.650
Don't worry.

15:03.650 --> 15:06.070
Hyuga will be playing the full match today.

15:06.070 --> 15:07.530
Wha–

15:07.530 --> 15:08.610
Is that true?!

15:09.070 --> 15:09.950
Yes.

15:09.950 --> 15:13.780
Last night, Hyuga did the exact same thing you are doing right now.

15:13.780 --> 15:15.120
Kojiro...

15:16.080 --> 15:17.290
Coach...

15:19.080 --> 15:23.670
<i>Now, both teams have come on to the pitch for the pre-game warm up.</i>

15:24.290 --> 15:25.170
Nankatsu!

15:25.170 --> 15:26.300
Tsubasa!

15:26.300 --> 15:28.550
Hyuga, you'd better play today!

15:29.010 --> 15:32.340
<i>I will announce the starting players for both teams now.</i>

15:32.340 --> 15:37.180
<i>Nankatsu MS, representing Shizuoka Prefecture, will wear their white jerseys.</i>

15:38.100 --> 15:41.230
<i>Morisaki as goalkeeper.</i>

15:41.230 --> 15:47.900
<i>Nakazato, Oda, Takasugi and Ishizaki as defenders.</i>

15:47.900 --> 15:48.690
Heh.

15:48.690 --> 15:52.110
<i>For the midfielders, Tsubasa Ozora...</i>

15:53.110 --> 15:55.160
So he will play today too, eh?

15:55.160 --> 15:56.620
Good job! Don't mind the injury!

15:56.620 --> 15:58.370
It wouldn't be fun without you!

15:58.950 --> 16:01.210
God, look how popular he is.

16:01.210 --> 16:03.750
We feel kinda out of place here!

16:03.750 --> 16:06.210
Must be fun and nice to be the popular guy!

16:06.210 --> 16:11.510
<i>And now: Toho Academy, representing Tokyo, will wear their black jerseys.</i>

16:11.510 --> 16:14.130
<i>Wakashimazu as goalkeeper.</i>

16:15.510 --> 16:21.390
<i>Furuta, Kawade, Imai and Takashima as defenders.</i>

16:21.390 --> 16:28.020
<i>Sawada, Koike, Shimada and Matsuki as midfielders.</i>

16:28.020 --> 16:30.030
<i>Forwards will be Sorimachi...</i>

16:31.360 --> 16:32.610
<i>...and Hyuga.</i>

16:33.280 --> 16:34.660
Is Hyuga playing?

16:34.660 --> 16:36.990
We were waiting for you, Toho's Ace!

16:36.990 --> 16:39.700
<i>Just listen to the loud cheering.</i>

16:39.700 --> 16:45.670
<i>This huge audience was desperately waiting for Hyuga to play in a match!</i>

16:45.670 --> 16:46.830
Hyuga!

16:46.830 --> 16:47.670
So, you made it.

16:47.670 --> 16:49.000
<i>I'll do it.</i>

16:49.000 --> 16:51.420
<i>I will take the championship for sure!</i>

16:55.470 --> 16:59.260
<i>Finishing their warm ups, both teams are heading to the locker rooms.</i>

16:59.260 --> 17:00.760
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

17:01.930 --> 17:02.930
Captain...!

17:02.930 --> 17:06.190
Were you really wearing a sweatshirt
under your jersey, in this heat?

17:06.190 --> 17:10.270
I wasn't exactly sitting on the bench doing nothing, you know.

17:10.270 --> 17:13.650
I've made my preparations for this blazing sun.

17:13.650 --> 17:15.820
This amount of heat won't exhaust me.

17:16.240 --> 17:22.080
In this match, the hotter it gets, the more of an advantage I'll have.

17:22.080 --> 17:23.330
Captain!

17:23.330 --> 17:27.250
<i>His muscles look even stronger, even after such a short period of time.</i>

17:27.250 --> 17:31.550
<i>Hyuga really came back with a body like tempered steel.</i>

17:33.050 --> 17:36.050
RESIGNATION NOTICE

17:34.550 --> 17:36.050
All right, boys, listen up.

17:36.050 --> 17:37.380
Be confident!

17:37.380 --> 17:40.720
You can definitely win with your current strength.

17:40.720 --> 17:43.100
It's high time we dethroned Nankatsu!

17:43.100 --> 17:45.850
We'll return to Toho Academy with the championship pennant!

17:45.850 --> 17:46.850
Yes, sir!

17:46.850 --> 17:49.350
Yeah, this year we will do it!

17:48.270 --> 17:52.110
<i>I think I'll worry about this after the match.</i>

17:52.110 --> 17:55.320
NANKATSU MIDDLE SCHOOL
SHIZUOKA PREFECTURE

17:52.610 --> 17:55.320
I won't waste my time with trivialities.

17:55.320 --> 17:59.700
All you need to do is play like you always do.

17:59.700 --> 18:00.740
Yes, sir!

18:00.740 --> 18:04.750
Tsubasa, do you have anything else to add as the captain?

18:04.750 --> 18:05.830
Yes, sir.

18:08.580 --> 18:11.080
I am really glad that I was admitted to Nankatsu MS

18:11.080 --> 18:16.510
and that I was able to play football with you guys for the past three years.

18:16.510 --> 18:19.680
In our last match today, after coming all the way here... let's win!

18:19.680 --> 18:21.720
Let's win and make our V3 dream into reality!

18:21.720 --> 18:23.220
Yeah!

18:23.220 --> 18:25.390
It's on, guys!

18:23.680 --> 18:25.270
Nankatsu, it's time!

18:25.270 --> 18:26.430
Sure.

18:26.430 --> 18:27.890
Okay, let's go guys!

18:27.890 --> 18:29.350
Yes, sir!

18:29.350 --> 18:30.690
Tsubasa.

18:30.690 --> 18:31.400
Take this.

18:32.270 --> 18:33.110
Sure.

18:34.020 --> 18:37.860
<i>This is my last match as Nankatsu's captain.</i>

18:37.860 --> 18:40.990
<i>I will complete my middle school football career undefeated,</i>

18:40.990 --> 18:46.620
<i>and this time, I'll go to Roberto's country, Brazil!</i>

18:46.620 --> 18:48.660
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

18:46.620 --> 18:48.660
Toho, it's time!

18:48.660 --> 18:50.920
Let's get going, guys!

18:50.920 --> 18:51.670
Yeah!

18:51.670 --> 18:53.090
We will do it!

18:53.090 --> 18:54.130
Dethrone Nankatsu!

18:54.130 --> 18:54.880
That's it!

18:56.090 --> 18:58.970
<i>If you think about it, all of them are my cute little players.</i>

19:00.130 --> 19:04.140
<i>Good job on enduring my tough training this long.</i>

19:04.140 --> 19:06.890
How's your condition, Tsubasa?

19:06.890 --> 19:07.810
It's okay.

19:07.810 --> 19:10.020
I'll do my best, even if I get hurt in the process.

19:10.020 --> 19:12.150
Now, that's the spirit.

19:12.600 --> 19:14.150
Doctor!

19:14.150 --> 19:16.730
I will take care of you after the match.

19:16.730 --> 19:19.490
You're going to play anyway, so give it everything you've got!

19:20.240 --> 19:25.160
<i>The National Middle School Football Tournament's final match is about to start.</i>

19:25.160 --> 19:27.490
<i>Both teams are making their appearance.</i>

19:28.910 --> 19:30.290
Big bro!

19:30.290 --> 19:35.130
<i>It's Nankatsu MS, representing Shizuoka, against Toho Academy, representing Tokyo.</i>

19:35.130 --> 19:37.750
NAGASAKI
HIRADO MS

19:35.790 --> 19:40.130
<i>It's been the same final match these past three years.</i>

19:40.130 --> 19:43.180
<i>I am sure both teams will show us many great plays</i>

19:40.130 --> 19:43.180
OSAKA
AZUMAICHI MS

19:43.180 --> 19:45.390
<i>in these 60 minutes of the match, leaving us unable to divert our eyes</i>

19:43.180 --> 19:45.390
AKITA
TACHIBANA HOUSEHOLD

19:45.390 --> 19:51.140
<i>as they start with their best members.</i>

19:45.390 --> 19:48.390
WAKASHIMAZU HOUSEHOLD

19:51.690 --> 19:57.690
Dear, are you really going to take
football away from Ken if he loses?

19:57.690 --> 20:00.240
That was the condition I let him play under until now.

20:00.780 --> 20:04.030
Ken is on the pitch every match, fully aware of this.

20:04.030 --> 20:07.830
<i>The ball goes to Toho Academy with the coin toss.</i>

20:07.830 --> 20:09.790
<i>It's been a while since I've been on the pitch.</i>

20:09.790 --> 20:12.830
<i>Please, guys, lend me your strength.</i>

20:13.870 --> 20:16.000
<i>The first year of middle school's tournament...</i>

20:18.000 --> 20:20.300
<i>Tsubasa shoots with an overhead kick!</i>

20:20.300 --> 20:22.380
<i>Nankatsu get their first championship!</i>

20:22.380 --> 20:23.840
<i>Last year...</i>

20:23.840 --> 20:24.510
<i>Let's go!</i>

20:24.510 --> 20:25.590
<i>Sure!</i>

20:25.590 --> 20:27.010
<i>...in that tournament too...</i>

20:29.060 --> 20:30.310
<i>It's in!</i>

20:30.310 --> 20:33.480
<i>Nankatsu accomplish their V2, reigning over the country!</i>

20:34.690 --> 20:37.810
<i>I refuse to lose any more, Tsubasa.</i>

20:37.810 --> 20:41.490
<i>I will return the shame I've felt these past 3 years,</i>

20:41.490 --> 20:45.200
<i>with this last match of my middle school—and student—life.</i>

20:45.610 --> 20:47.490
<i>The match will start at noon.</i>

20:47.490 --> 20:50.200
<i>The fateful moment is closing in!</i>

20:50.200 --> 20:51.290
5,4,3,2,1,0!

20:51.290 --> 20:56.460
5,4,3,2,1,0!

20:58.290 --> 21:00.050
<i>The match finally begins!</i>

21:00.050 --> 21:04.090
<i>The whistle for the match of the century rings loud and clear!</i>

21:04.510 --> 21:05.720
Let's go, guys!

21:05.720 --> 21:06.590
Yeah!

21:10.680 --> 21:15.690
<i>Hyuga is already getting ready to shoot at the center circle!</i>

21:16.650 --> 21:17.900
What?!

21:17.900 --> 21:18.860
<i>Here he comes.</i>

21:18.860 --> 21:20.820
<i>He is coming right from the start!</i>

21:20.820 --> 21:23.240
<i>I was right to stay in the back!</i>

21:23.900 --> 21:25.650
Eat this, Nankatsu!

21:25.650 --> 21:26.820
This is my...

21:28.160 --> 21:31.080
Tiger Shot!

21:34.660 --> 21:35.160
It's fast!

21:35.160 --> 21:41.380
<i>Hyuga's long shot rips ahead towards Nankatsu's goal on a low trajectory!</i>

21:43.880 --> 21:46.170
<i>It smashes into the post!</i>

21:46.170 --> 21:49.760
<i>The goalkeeper, Morisaki, is dumbfounded right now, unable to move an inch!</i>

21:49.760 --> 21:51.510
<i>Crap!</i>

21:53.180 --> 21:56.270
<i>The ball is punctured!</i>

21:57.270 --> 21:58.810
What an amazing shot!

21:58.810 --> 22:00.150
That's Hyuga for you!

22:00.150 --> 22:01.150
Big bro!

22:01.150 --> 22:02.980
<i>Such power in it...</i>

22:02.980 --> 22:08.160
<i>Did Hyuga come up with a terrific shot in such a short amount of time...?</i>

22:08.160 --> 22:08.950
Damn!

22:09.660 --> 22:13.240
<i>The final match has started in a shocking way!</i>

22:13.240 --> 22:17.750
<i>Kojiro Hyuga, The Ferocious Tiger, makes his triumphant return!</i>

22:38.690 --> 22:44.730
<i>chotto are mi na ace ga tooru</i>

22:38.690 --> 22:44.730
<i>Hey, look over there at the ace passing through</i>

22:44.730 --> 22:50.740
<i>suguremono zo to machijû sawagu</i>

22:44.730 --> 22:50.740
<i>He's the best, and the whole town cheers him on</i>

22:50.740 --> 22:56.790
<i>chô-chô samba, zigzag samba</i>

22:50.740 --> 22:56.790
<i>Butterfly samba, zig-zag samba</i>

22:56.790 --> 23:01.420
<i>aitsu no uwasa de chamba mo hashiru</i>

22:56.790 --> 23:01.420
<i>Even little old ladies go around talking about him</i>

23:03.040 --> 23:07.710
<i>sore ni tsukete mo ore-tacha nan na no</i>

23:03.040 --> 23:07.710
<i>So, even if we have him, who are we?</i>

23:09.050 --> 23:15.140
<i>ball hitotsu ni kiri-kiri mai sa</i>

23:09.050 --> 23:15.140
<i>The ball spins round and round</i>

23:15.140 --> 23:21.190
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:21.190 --> 23:25.650
<i>itsuka kimeru ze inazuma shoot</i>

23:21.190 --> 23:25.650
<i>One day, I'll score with a lightning shot!</i>

23:26.940 --> 23:33.280
<i>son toki ore ga super hero sa</i>

23:26.940 --> 23:33.280
<i>When that happens, I'll become a super hero!</i>

23:33.280 --> 23:39.330
<i>Dash, dash, dash! Kick and dash!</i>

23:39.330 --> 23:45.630
<i>moete seishun kakenukero</i>

23:39.330 --> 23:45.630
<i>This fierce youth is on the field!</i>

23:49.880 --> 23:59.730
COMING UP, EPISODE 47:
A FATEFUL SHOWDOWN, ONCE AGAIN
